# Celestial Reunion: "choose a creature type and behold two creatures of that type" (CR 601.2b-c, 701.4a). A Chomping
# Changeling is every creature type (CR 702.73a, in a hand too), so two of them in Bot1's hand share any type at all: Bird is
# offered though neither is a Bird by its printed types. Bot1 chooses Bird and beholds both; the Birds of Paradise it finds
# (mana value 1, exactly X) is a Bird, so it enters the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Celestial Reunion
Chomping Changeling
Chomping Changeling
Forest
Forest
Birds of Paradise
Elvish Mystic
Forest x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Celestial Reunion.Cast(X: 1)
Bot1.Modes(Choose a creature type and behold two creatures of that type)
Bot1.Modes(Bird)
Bot1.Choose(Bot1.Hand.Chomping Changeling; Bot1.Hand.Chomping Changeling#2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Search(Birds of Paradise)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Birds of Paradise.Power = 0
Bot1.Hand = Chomping Changeling; Chomping Changeling; Forest; Forest
Bot1.Graveyard = Celestial Reunion
